<BaseLayout title="What Is DNS? The Domain Name System Explained" description="DNS explained from first principles: what the Domain Name System is, how names resolve to IP addresses, and why every website and email depends on it." schema={[faq]} breadcrumb={[["Home", "/"], ["DNS Guide", "/dns/"], ["What Is DNS"]]}>
